('recGe2FRGAahGnwO9', '2026-07-15', 'Ivan Sabado', 'SVM', 8, 574, 8, 574, NULL, 'July 15, 2026 Progress Report Project: E Ink I evaluated the Pattern Extract tool in EdgeWise for structural modeling and tested its semi-automatic feature for modeling structural beams. After testing, I concluded that EdgeWise could not accurately refit the beam elements because many of the beams are bent or irregular, and the point cloud contains unclear or incomplete scan data. As a result, I used EdgeWise only for modeling the structural columns and continued modeling the structural beams manually in Revit to ensure better accuracy. Current Progress Structural Columns: 100% Structural Beams: 50% Estimated Date of Delivery (EDD – Structural): July 17, 2026', 'NO', 'N/A', '2026-07-15', 'Approved', NULL, '2026-07-15', 'N', '1.000'),
